⍝ Note: This test requires a great deal of ⎕WA to complete, depending upon the resolution of your default printer
⍝       For instance, even even simple operations on a 600dpi printer can require 256Mb or more available in ⎕WA
⍝       Other operations may require 3-4 times that much memory, and higher-resolution printers can be several times as much as that

 '#'∆WI Pass MT⊢'Reset' ⍝ Clean out any previous GUI work
 apldir←{⍵↑⍨(⍵∊'/\')⌈.×⍳≢⍵}⊃2 ⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
 bmpfile←apldir,'ws\cars.bmp' ⋄ bmpfile←bmpfile/⍨⎕NEXISTS bmpfile ⍝ Look for a standard BMP file for testing (modifiable)
 icofile←apldir,'ws\aplicon.ico' ⋄ icofile←icofile/⍨⎕NEXISTS icofile ⍝ Look for a standard ICO file for testing (modifiable)
 ⎕FX↑'result←left ∆wi right' 'result←Res←left ∆WI right' ⍝ Something to assign a semi-global result

 'p'∆WI Pass(,'p')⊢'New' 'Printer'
 drawclear←'Draw'('Brush' 1(3⍴255))'Clear' ⍝ Reset the picture to White before testing each one
 'p'∆wi Pass{6 2≡⍴⍵}⊢'units' ⋄ units←Res

 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 1(192 0 0)1)('Line'(2 2⍴5 5 20 50))('Pen' 3(0 192 0)1)('Line'(2 2⍴5 50 20 5))
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 1(192 0 0)1)('Seg'(5 5,5 10,10 5,10 10,15 5,15 10))
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Rect' 10 60 5 30)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 2(255 0 0)10)('Brush' 0)('Rect' 0 0 5 30) ⍝? Why does this look like it has rounded corners?
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Ellipse' 10 60 5 30)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 1(255 0 0)1)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Poly'(3 2⍴2 10,10 5,10 15))

 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Circle' 10 50 5)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Circle' 10 50 5 2)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Circle' 10 50 5 0.5)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Circle' 10 50 5 ¯2)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Circle' 10 50 5 ¯0.5)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Scale' 5)('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Circle' 100 500 50)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Scale' 5)('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Circle' 100 500 50 2)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Scale' 5)('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Circle' 100 500 50 0.5)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Scale' 5)('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Circle' 100 500 50 ¯2)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Scale' 5)('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Circle' 100 500 50 ¯0.5)

 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Circle' 10 50 5 2 45 135 7)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Chord' 10 50 5 2 45 135 7)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' 1(255 0 0)3)('Brush' 5(0 0 128))('Point'((⊂0 0 0),⍨↑,(5×⍳5)∘.,10×⍳9))

 'p'∆wi Pass{1=≢⍵}⊢'Draw'('?Pen' 1(255 0 0)3) ⋄ ph←⊃Res
 'p'∆wi Pass{1=≢⍵}⊢'Draw'('?Brush' 5(0 0 128)) ⋄ bh←⊃Res
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' ¯1 ph)('Brush' ¯1 bh)('Circle' 10 50 5)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Pen' ¯1 ph)('Brush' ¯2 bmpfile)('Circle' 10 50 5)

 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Mode' 0)('Font' 'Arial' 1 0 'ansi')('Color'(3⍴255)(3⍴0))('Text' 'This is a test...' 5 5)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Mode' 0)('Color'(3⍴255)(3⍴0))('Text'('This is a',(⎕UCS 13),'two-line test...')5 5)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Mode' 0)('Color'(3⍴255)(3⍴0))('Text'(↑'This is a' 'three-line' 'test...')5 5)
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Mode' 0)('Font' 'Arial' 1 0 'ansi' 45)('Color'(3⍴255)(3⍴0))('Text' 'This is a test...' 5 5)
 'p'∆wi Pass{1=≢⍵}⊢'Draw'('?Font' 'Arial' 1 0 'ansi') ⋄ fh←⊃Res
 'p'∆WI Pass MT⊢drawclear,('Mode' 0)('Font'fh)('Color'(3⍴255)(3⍴0))('Text' 'This is a test...' 5 5)

